<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc1">Romans</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">ROM HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Romans</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Rom hae kalan Paul Ccaky</char> tuh Paul nynh Rom Khriccaawbuu kalan khuaccong a ry keiccuze laanpi a sahku typaw nynh thua. A paccynkunaw tuh tuin kya-e Khriccaaw hae kya sosoh ryalawsya koute mimaw bawmnaw liate Spain ram lang sulue lanpaw kha nynh athua. Khriccaaw zynnaw te tuh-e zynnaw kha Khriccaaw hae hiinnaw kya asuilan a um lanpaw te mang lan cipaw kha amaw a nynaw thyhte ccaesahpya nawlan a zeipaw nynh thua. Hynh-e ccauh lungkhu kya Paul nynh phunghopaw atungpi balyn accing lante a um.</para>
  <para style="ip">Rom khua e khriccaawbuu kha a beihlang kou hae te mih hanlan saw a sangpyanaw hae a hopyanaw hae paw te Paul ccaky nynh a paccynpaw tuh: “Pachia nynh pawcitemou amaw te a ccungccaw hae laku kya ccawkunaw a rae cipaw kha thehoypaw nynh a langsaku. Tuh-e tuh athonaw te athangnaw cia zynnaw liate nynh thua,” cipaw kha a ho (1.17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tuinte Paul nynh a paccynkunaw kha accing lante a langsaku. Juda hae thuasah, Zenta hae thuasah, ccungccaw miakaw Pachia te ccawku myarya aho, pawccecize ah balynte seinaw zakaw nynh marya ah um oh. Ccungccaw hae tuh Jesu Khri zynnaw liate nynh Pachia te ccawsaku athua. Pachia ryte kyngkunaw liate hiinnaw thawpaw kyate yn poupaw Khri ryte kyngkunawpaw hiinnaw thawpaw kong kha bua a ho. Zyntu tuh Pachia ryte daenaw hoi hae zah Pachia Muisaw liate chinaw te seinaw zakaw kyate a luesah vae. Byaria 5-8 lungkhu kya Paul nynh zyntu hiinnaw kya Pachia Kawbya te Pachia Muisaw huhan paccynnaw kong kha a ho. Tukoute Pachia nynh ccungccaw hanlan a paccyn typaw lungkhu lang pawcitemou Juda hae te Zenta hae a teethya cih hae cipaw byakhianaw a tung. Juda hae nynh Jesu a vua hae paw hynh zemah ccungccaw balyn Pachia thawccinaw Jesu Khri kya thuasahnaw lanpaw Pachia paccynnaw ccangkheit thuabua zah Juda hae nynh Jesu tuh zungzae vua khyh hae cite a zynnawpaw kha mah a ho. Athangnaw kya Paul nynh pawcitemou Khriccaaw hae hiin lan cipaw kong, alae lante ming hae ryte ccuepekunawpaw sungsakunaw kong kha a zei. Hynh-e hae balyn tuh Pachia ryalawpaw nynh thua cite tho zah Khriccaaw hae nynh accozah te lu kheit te lu kheit tungvaw kya rya hoi zia te thyahoy laesahnaw te kyngkuh zah byakhianaw cia a langsaku. Pachia thehoysahnaw bya hae te lu raveih phunghonaw hae ryte a ccaky a thangsah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw te a paccynnaw — 1.1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Ccungccaw nynh khumnaw ahobounaw zia — 1.18—13.20</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia Khumnaw laanpi — 3.21—4.25</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri lungkhu kya hiinnaw thawpaw — 5.1—8.39</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia paccynnaw kya Israel — 9.1—11.36</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaaw hae ziazae — 12.1—15.13</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw te pyn raveih beihlangkunaw — 15.14—16.27</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khri seepaw, Pachia thehoypaw hanlan thoh phia thua zah locceihtu lang ko athuapaw kae, Paul nynh ccaw kae ky oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e thehoypaw tuh a profeh hae liate athyaapaw Ccathyaa hae kyakhe langmawpi te bya phe la kinty vae paw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e thehoypaw tuh Pachia Ccapaw, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri konglang thua zah pynsaw lante David ciihan kyate yn puipaw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thyaanaw kya-e muisaw lante ho lanze, chinaw kyate a thoothuinaw liate Pachia Ccapaw athuanaw kha athungpaw huhan te phy athua vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Zenta hae balyn kya amaw min hanlan zynnaw te asekuhpaw kawngaenaw a um nawlan thawccinaw te locceihtu thuanaw kha amaw liate kae mue vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e hae laku kya nanning mah Jesu Khri kya-e thua khylan kopaw nynh na thuabua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh sungsah hae zah mithyaa hae lang ko na thua oh paw, Rom khuaccaaw hae nae balyn tungvaw kyakhe ah Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kyate oun thuapaw thawccinaw te daenaw tuh la um vae sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lungtua Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nae zynnaw tuh laephi pynpi kya siakhae athua keiccuze nae balyn hanlan Jesu Khri liate ka Pachia kha masaty ka luung. <verse number="9" style="v" />A Ccapaw kya-e thehoypaw kha hote ka thinlung balyn te rya ka lawpyapaw Pachia tuh ka sawsangnaw kya nanning kha zungzae kae lia oh cipaw a nyhtu ka ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia nynh a ry zetuh ccyhkhakheit kya pawpawte thua zemah nae kalan khuaccong lan saw ka sangkuh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize nae thawzung tynsahnaw lanpaw muisaw lasung abang kha neethung khylan myarya kae muih ry oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh nanning te kae nynh zynnaw raveih khate thawzung ah pyaku kalang ccaw oh cipaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Uteno hae, ccangpaw Zenta hae laku kya athae abang ka mue hawte nanning laku kya mah athae abang mue khylan nae kalan ccia lan palei ka noukuh cipaw nysah kae ry oh, thuasalama atu cia yn khawpaw palei a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Loc 19.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae tuh Grik hae te apuathopaw ccungccaw hae kya thuasah, a hawpaw te a ngaeepaw kya thuasah parouh mawte laebah umtu nynh ka thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Rom khua kya na um oh paw kalan mah thehoypaw phy lan lungthote ka um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thehoypaw A Thungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh thehoypaw hanlan ka maethah khyh; pawccecize thehoypaw tuh a zynpaw ccungccaw miakaw hanlan khumnaw mue nawlan Pachia thungnaw nynh thua, masaty lan Judah hae hanlan thua zah tukoute Grik hae hanlan mah athuabua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar 8.38</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize, “Adingpaw ccungccaw tuh zynnaw liate nynh a hiin cih,” cite azeiku hawte, tuh-e zynnaw kya nynh Pachia kya-e dingnaw tuh zynnaw kyate zynnaw kalan langsahpya athua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw hae Seimenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachia thinrianaw tuh vaawlang te yn langkuh zah, byading a khawtu hae paw kya-e dingleinaw te Pachia pawlangria leinaw balyn kha a rawse. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia konglang ny khonaw kha Pachia nynh minmin kya a langsah vae keiccuze tuh-e tuh minmin kya phe a langkuh vae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Laephi raenaw kyate tho zah Pachia kya-e muih kho leipaw zungzae atynpaw thungnaw te Pachia thuanaw kha a raepaw uccaw hae liate thaethya thua vae zah muih kho athua vae, tukeiccuze minmin tuh ngaethya kho thua lan khyh hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />pawccecize minmin nynh Pachia phang nyh hae pite, Pachia kha sawtua lan accan thyhte sawtua khyh hae, luung mah luung khyh hae, mih tuakunaw tuh accakaepaw lang tang zah tuanaw hoi leipaw mih thinlung tuh mohnaw te phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efe 4.17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh kae haw cikuh hae zah mingaee lang nynh a tang hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />arohthya leipaw Pachia phu-enaw kha arohthyapaw ccungccaw, pavaw, ccupali saepaw loramsaw te avawpaw loramsaw muinsan lang raepaw zohtuh hae te a rulae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Deu 4.16-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh mah minmin kha mimaw te mimaw laku kya mih pyn kha thethyasah khylan mih thinlung kya-e duaanaw thyhte anungsikuhpaw kalan a ap hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia byaccing kha hynbya lang a paleih hae, Raetu Pachia laeze raepaw uccaw kha beik hae zah rya a lawpya hae. Tuh-e Raetu Bawipaw tuh zungzae thehoysah athua! Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze Pachia nynh minmin kha maethya lan umpaw chiisaw rynaw kalan a ap hae, pawccecize mih nopi hae nynh aphung thyhte ikheihnaw kha vua hae zah aphung thua leipaw ikheihnaw kha a mang hae; <verse number="27" style="v" />tuhawte pise hae nynh mah nopi te aphung thyhte ikheihnaw kha vua hae zah, pise te pise mih chiisaw rynaw tuh maee lang arua. Pise te pise nynh maethya lan umpaw kha a cyi hae keiccuze mih cyiseinaw thyhte detahnaw kha a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia kha a ny ry khyh hae keiccuze Pachia nynh athahpaw thinlung kalan ap hae zah minmin nynh angaekuh leipaw uccaw hae kha a cyi hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin tuh hoyleinaw aphuinphuin, athahpaw, karankunaw, othyanaw, eiungnaw, ccungccaw chianaw, pekumaekunaw, lingkunaw, thyaruhnaw, thanhonaw te phe abeih hae, <verse number="30" style="v" />thethya hotu hae, Pachia a huatu hae, a bunglepaw, a tansakuh hae paw, a pookuh hae paw, ahoy leipaw uccaw raetu hae, nungpaaw kawngae lei hae paw, <verse number="31" style="v" />a ngaee hae paw, lungzi lei hae paw, thawccinaw hoi lei hae paw, rysawthah hae paw nynh thua hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Hynhcihawpaw uccaw hae a cyih hae paw tuh chi lan accan hae cipaw Pachia byapianaw kha phang a nyh hae pite hynh-e uccaw hae hynh a cyi hae apiaze hynhcihawpaw a cyih hae paw kha thaw a pya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byapianaw Adingpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang tuh humhung na thua zemah milae kha bya na pia ze, ngaethya kho na thua lan khyh; pawccecize bya na pianawpaw uccaw ccaccei maw kha na cyibua keiccuze milae bya na pianaw kya namaw toulou kha sei na bekuhpaw nynh na thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat 7.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia nynh tuhcihawpaw uccaw a raetu hae kha byaccing thyhte bya a pia hae cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhcihawpaw uccaw a cyihtupaw kha bya na pia zah namaw nynh tuh-e uccaw tuh na cyibua ze, Pachia byapianaw kyate ka lue cih cite na tuakuh tou? <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze myarya lepaw a thawccinaw, a ngaesangnaw te a lungsaenaw kha pawlangria leite tou na ung? Pachia thawccinaw nynh nang kha ngaesikunaw kalan ae cciakhae cipaw na nyh khyh tou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama na lungkhungnaw te ngaesiku ry leinaw thinlung keiccuze Pachia kya-e adingpaw byapianaw langsapyaku nin, thinrianaw nin kya namaw hanlan thinrianaw kha na ccyku. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha a cyisahnaw thyhte amee a pya cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sam 62.12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Ptb 24.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahoypaw rya kha lungsaete lah zah phu-enaw, sawtuanaw te chi kho leinaw a ccung hae paw tuh Pachia nynh zungzae hiinnaw kha a pya cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama mimaw hanlan kyalya tua hae zah byaccing kaw kha ngae leite hoyleinaw kaw a ngae hae paw tungvaw kya Pachia bungpawnaw te thinrianaw a um cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Masaty lan Judah hae, tukoute Zenta hae mah hoyleinaw a raepaw miakaw tuh vawsawnaw te lungriathaenaw kha a tung cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama masaty lan Judah hae, tukoute Zenta hae mah hoynaw a raepaw miakaw tuh Pachia nynh phu-enaw, sawtuanaw te daenaw kha a pya cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia tuh mirymihuapo khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deu 10.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya ny leite a sei hae paw balyn tuh Kawbya leite a roh cih hae; Kawbya mang a nyh hae pite a sei hae paw balyn mah Kawbya thyhte byapia athua cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya a thae hae paw hynh Pachia malang a ding hae paw thua khyh, thuasalama Kawbya a zui hae paw kha nynh ading cite ci athua cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya hoi lei hae paw Zenta hae nynh kawbya a hoi lei hae pite kawbya kya umpaw uccaw hae kha aphung lante he a zui hae tuh, tuh-e tuh mih hanlan Kawbya lang yn tang. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih thinlung kya azeikuhpaw Kawbya kya-e bya hae kha a langsah hae, mimaw nykunaw thinlung nynh mah ccaekia a khan; pawccecize mih tuanaw nynh mimaw kha vaekhakheit seibe zah, vaekhakheit a ngaethya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kae nynh ka hopaw thehoypaw thyhte Pachia nynh Jesu Khri liate ccungccaw balyn nynh aruh lante a tuaku hae paw kha byapianaw nin kya bya a pia cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah hae te Kawbya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang nynh Judah paw na cikuh zah Kawbya kha doliakute Pachia te na kyngkunaw oh kyakhe na pooku. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachia rynaw kha na nyh zah Kawbya te thuihei na thua keiccuze ahoy huapaw uccaw hae kha na phiathya zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />nang tuh mitmoh hae kha laanpi cciakhaetu te mohnaw kya um hae paw kha awnaw muihsahtu nynh ka thua, <verse number="20" style="v" />mingaee hae kha a thuiheitu, imua hae kha a ccangpahtu, Kawbya kya umpaw byaccing te nynaw a hoipaw nynh ka thua cite na zynku ze, <verse number="21" style="v" />mingccang hae kha na ccangpah hae zah namaw te namaw so na ccangpakuh khyh tou? Ruh nan oh cite phung na ho zah namaw so na ruh tou? <verse number="22" style="v" />Milae zu seikhae nan oh cite na ho zah namaw so milae zu na seikhae tou? Zohtuh kha luathua-ae-uipaw lang na ria zah namaw so zohtuh beikinn uccaw kha na luade tou? <verse number="23" style="v" />Kawbya kya na pookuh zah kawbya ronaw liate Pachia kha the na thyaasah tou? <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze, “Nanning keiccuze Pachia min tuh Zenta hae laku kya thethya ccousah athua,” cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52.5</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang nynh Kawbya kha na zui ze, vingdungawkupaw tuh athane ccaccing; thuasalama nang tuh Kawbya kha na ro ze, na vingdungawkupaw tuh vingdungawku leipaw lang nynh phe a tang. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vingdungawkuh leipaw nynh Kawbya kya-e bya hae kha a zui lanze, a vingdungawku leinaw tuh vingdungawkunaw lang riapya thua lan khyh tou? <verse number="27" style="v" />Pynsaw lante vingdung a awku khyh zemah Kawbya a zuipaw ccungccaw nynh Kawbya azeikuhpaw na hoi zah vingdung mang na awkuh pite kawbya na zui leipaw nang kha sei ae be cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize atolang te kyalya Judah athuapaw tuh Judah ccungccaw ccaccing thua khyh; ngesaw kya atolang te kyalya vingdungawkunaw mah vingdungawkunaw ccaccing thua khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Alungkhu langte Judah athuapaw nynh Judah ccungccaw ccaccing athua; ahmepaw vingdungawkunaw tuh thinlung te asekuhpaw nynh thua—tuh-e tuh zeipaw kawbya keiccu thua leite muisaw liate nynh thua. Tuhcihawpaw ccungccaw nynh a ccoupaw thehoynaw tuh ccungccaw hae kyate thua leite Pachia kyate nynh athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Deu 30.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhteze, Judah ccungccaw thuanaw hynh pawmou athane? Tuhkhyhze vingdungawkunaw hynh amee um tou? <verse number="2" style="v" />Aphuinphuin te thanenaw patae a um. Masaty lan Judah hae nynh Pachia kya-e bya kha a mue hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin abang nynh mih lungzi khyh ze pawtemou athua cih? Mih lungzi leinaw nynh Pachia kya-e lungzinaw kha a roh kho cih tou? <verse number="4" style="v" />Roh kho lan khyh! Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na hopaw bya tuh hme zah</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ae pia vae hae ze</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh na tae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku hawte, ccungccaw miakaw tuh ahynpaw thua hae salamah Pachia tuh ahmepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sam 51.4</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama aening ah dingleinaw oh nynh Pachia dingnaw kha a langsaku lanze, pawtemou ah ho cih oh? Pachia nynh aening tungvaw a thinria zah de oun tah vae ze, aning tuh ding khyh tou? (Ccungccaw phung te nynh ka ho.) <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhte thua khyh! Tuhte athua lanze Pachia nynh laephi hynh pawtemou bya a pia kho cih? <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize kae ka hynnaw liate Pachia byaccing nynh a phu-enaw kha houh a langsah ze, kae kha miseipaw lante pawccemou bya yn pia hae? <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccemou, “Ahoypaw a langku nawlan ahoy leipaw kha cyih oh sih,” cite ah ho khyh oh? Ccungccaw abang nynh kaening kha thethya oun ccousah ry hae pawte, tuhte na ho oh oun ci hae. Tuhte a hotu hae tuh seibe lan accan hae!</para>
  <para style="s1">Adingpaw Hum Sanmah Um Khyh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhteze pawtemou? Aening Judah hae tuh minmin laeze ah hoyhua oh tou? Ccapyh sanmah ah hoyhua khyh oh; pawccecize Judah hae te Zenta hae balyn tuh seinaw huhan zakaw nynh ah um oh cite langmaw phe kae langsaku vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Adingpaw hum san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit sanmah um khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Sam 14.1-3</ref> (LXX), <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53.1-3</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thaethyapaw hum san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kha a ccungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hum san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi pong me vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungkia vae khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoypaw a cyihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hum san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mih lotharue tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahungkuhpaw shaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lae kha hyn nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a mang hae, mih munglae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">huparepaw sy a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Sam 5.9</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="PSA 140:3">Sam 140.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mih khalang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalawnaw bya te</para>
  <para style="q2">bya khahpaw te nynh phe abia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Sam 10.7</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih ccu tuh chii luasah lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyrang;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa 59.7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih ccianaw laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw te riathaenaw a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />daenaw laanpi kha nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih mit kya</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia rawrinaw cipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">kharouh um khyh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Sam 36.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kawbya nynh a hopaw miakaw tuh Kawbya zakaw a um hae paw hanlan nynh a ho cipaw ah ny oh, tuh-e tuh khalang miakaw nynh bya a ho ngan khyh nawlan te laephi pynpi hynh Pachia byapianaw malang a thadyn lanpaw nynh thua cipaw alangku nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Kawbya zuinaw liate hum sanmah Pachia malang thyaaccou kho lan khyh; pawccecize Kawbya liate nynh seinaw kha nyku athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Sam 143.2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw liate Dingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh Kawbya te asekuh leipaw Pachia kya-e dingnaw kha yn langkuh vae; tuh-e kong tuh Kawbya te Profeh hae bya nynh ccaekia a khan hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Jesu Khri zynnaw liate a zynpaw balyn elang Pachia kya-e dingnaw nynh thua; laesahkunaw um vae khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tuh phe sei vae hae zah Pachia phu-enaw te a sawkuh vae hae; <verse number="24" style="v" />minmin tuh Khri Jesu shawkhawnaw liate Pachia thawccinaw keiccuze alakawte thyaaccousah athua vae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pachia nynh Khri kha a chiise liate seingaethyanaw elang silawnawpaw lang a tangsah, tuh-e Khri tuh zynnaw liate seingaethyanaw mue athua, tuhcite Pachia nynh a dingnaw kha a langsaku; pawccecize Pachia nynh a ngaesangnaw liate langmawlya e raepaw ccungccaw seinaw kha a ngaethya, <verse number="26" style="v" />atu vae tuh Pachia nynh amaw a dingnaw kha langsaku khylan te Jesu a zynpaw miakaw tuh thyaaccousah athuanaw kong kha langsaku khylan tuhcite a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhteze pookunaw tuh pawlangmou a tang? Pookunaw tuh vua athua. Paw kawbya te mou vua athua? Cyisahnaw kawbya liate tou? Thua khyh, zynnaw kawbya liate nynh vua athua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw tuh Kawbya cyisahnaw um leite zynnaw liate nynh thyaaccou athua cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pachia tuh Judah hae Pachia kyalya tou? Zenta hae Pachia so thuabua khyh tou? Athuabua, Zenta hae Pachia mah athuabua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Vingdung a awkuhpaw te vingdung a awkuh leipaw parouh mawte zynnaw liate thyaa a ccousah cih hae paw tuh Pachia ccangkheit rou nynh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Deu 6.4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal 3.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhteze aening nynh zynnaw liate Kawbya tuh ah vua oh tou? Ah vua khyh oh, Kawbya kha ah tynsah oh paw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhteze pynsaw lante ah minpaaw athuapaw Abraham kong hynh pawtemou ah ho cih oh? <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham tuh cyisahnaw liate thyaaccousah athua ze, pooku lanpaw a hoi, thuasalama Pachia malang pooku lanpaw hoi khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa nynh pawtemou a ho? “Abraham nynh Pachia kha zyn zah, tuh-e a zynnaw tuh dingnaw lang riapya athua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Gen 15.6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Ryalahpaw ccungccaw nynh a muepaw ryalaw mee kha lasung lang riapya thua khyh, tuh-e tuh atekuhpaw ryalaw mee nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Rya mah lah khyh zah Pachia mah a nyh leipaw ccungccaw kha thyaa a ccousahtupaw Pachia kha a zynpaw tuh, tuh-e a zynnaw kha dingnaw lang riapya athua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhawte cyisahnaw um leite Pachia nynh miding lante a tuapaw ccungccapaw kya-e lungtuanaw kong kha David nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mih hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya athua hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">mih seinaw kha bongpya</para>
  <para style="q2">athua hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Sam 32.1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh sei a be</para>
  <para style="q2">leipaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuapaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhteze, hynh-e lungtuanaw tuh vingdung a awkuh hae paw hanlan kyalya tou athua? Tuhkhyhze vingdung a awkuh lei hae paw hanlan so thuabua khyh tou? Pawccecize Abraham hanlan zynnaw kha dingnaw lang riapya athua cite ah ho oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhteze tuh-e tuh aning elang pawtemou riapya athua? Vingdung a awku maw tou, vingdung a awkuh koute tou? A awkuh koute riapyapaw thua khyh, a awku maw riapyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham nynh vingdung a awku mawze zynnaw liate a muepaw dingnaw tazeih athuapaw vingdungawkupaw syntawnaw kha a mue. Tuh-e tuh vingdungawku leite a zynpaw ccungccaw hae kha dingnaw lang riapya nawlan te Abraham tuh a zynpaw ccungccaw balyn paaw lang tang nawlan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Gen 17.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Abraham tuh vingdung a awkuh hae paw paaw lang tang khylan te vingdungawku kyalya thua leite ah minpaaw Abraham nynh vingdung a awku mawze a hoipaw zynnaw ccunoh a zui hae paw, vingdung a awkuh lei hae paw paaw lang mah tang khylan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw liate Byakinpyakupaw Ccounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize aning tuh laephi rhoccoutu athua cih cite Abraham kya te a ciihan hae kya yn thuapaw byakinpyakunaw tuh Kawbya liate thua khyh, zynnaw kya-e dingnaw liate nynh athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Gen 17.4-6</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal 3.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya a zui hae paw tuh rhoccoutu athua hae ze, zynnaw tuh alakaw vae, byakinpyakupaw mah ccungkia vae khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal 3.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya nynh tuh thinrianaw kha a thuakhae; thuasalama kawbya um leinaw kya tuh cyiseinaw mah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia byakinpyakunaw tuh thawccinaw liate thua zah Abraham ciihan hae balyn hanlan aamahkhankute zynnaw kya a thadynpaw nynh thua; tuh-e byakinpyakunaw tuh Kawbya a zui hae paw hanlan kyalya thua leite, aening ah balyn paaw athuapaw Abraham hawte zynnaw a hoi hae paw hanlan mah athuabua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze, “Nang kha minphuin patae paaw lang kae rae vae,” cite azeiku hawte, Abaraham tuh amaw nynh a zynpaw Pachia, a chih hae paw kha hiinsah hae zah a um loh leipaw uccaw hae kha um lan kaw a pya khopaw tuh-e Pachia malang khe aening ah balyn paaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Gen 17.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />“Na ciihan hae tuh myarya a lung cih hae,” cite a hopyapaw bya thyhawte Abraham nynh kae tuh “minphuin patae paaw” lang ka tang cih cite ngaehoi lan accan lei pite zyn zah a ngaehoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning tuh kum za kheit loukaw a ci vae zemah a pyn tuh michi hawte tuaku leite, a zu Sarah vue mah a tiin vae cite tua leite zynnaw kya a thawzya khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Gen 17.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia nynh bya a kinpyakupaw kha lunghiinnaw hoi leite, a zynnaw mah zyabung khyh, a zynnaw kya a thawsae zah Pachia kha phu-enaw a pya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia nynh bya a kinkupaw kha a ccingsah kho cite varyng a zyn. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a zynnaw kha dingnaw lang riapya athua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhte “riapya athua” cite Ccathyaa kya azeikuhpaw hynh Abraham elang kyalya thua khyh, <verse number="24" style="v" />aening hanlan mah azeikuhpaw nynh thua. Ah Bawipaw Jesu kha chinaw kyate a thoosahtupaw Pachia kha aening nynh ah zyn oh ze tuh-e zynnaw tuh aening dingnaw lang riapya athua cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu tuh aening seinaw keiccuze ccungccaw hae kalan ap hae zah, aening thyaaccounaw hanlan thoosahthui athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa 53.4-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thyaaccounaw kyate Muepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zynnaw liate thyaaccousah ah thua vae oh zah, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate aening tuh Pachia te ah ccawkuh vae oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aening ah thadynnaw oh hynh-e thawccinaw lungkhu lang amaw zynnaw liate nynh aening naeku khonaw ah hoi oh; Pachia phu-enaw kha neethungku lan ah ngaehoi oh zah ah lungtua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Hynh-e kya kyalya thua khyh, aening ah teingnaw oh kya mah ah lungtua; pawccecize teingnaw nynh ngaesangnaw kha a thuakhae cipaw ah ny oh; <verse number="4" style="v" />ngaesangnaw nynh Pachia lungtungnaw kha a thuakhae, tuh-e lungtungnaw nynh ngaehoinaw kha a thuakhae; <verse number="5" style="v" />ngaehoinaw nynh lungronaw kha oun pya khyh, pawccecize Pachia nynh aening oun pyapaw Thyaa Muisaw liate a sungsahnaw kha ah thinlung kya oun bu vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize aening ah thawzya ccyh lyakhe Khri tuh accyh zawte Pachia nyh lei hae paw hanlan a chih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Adingpaw ccungccaw hanlan a chipah cih paw ccungccaw kou akhin cih, tuhzemah ccungccaw hoypaw hanlan a chih nganpaw poh um ccamah ny lei. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama aening tuh misei hae ah thua cciamang lya oh khe, Khri nynh aening hanlan oun chipyapaw tuh Pachia nynh aening kha pawcih nynh oun sungsah cipaw a langsakunawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu tuh a chiise liate thyaaccousah ah thua vae oh zah, amaw liate Pachia thinrianaw kyate khum ah thua vae cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh Pachia rhaw hae ah thua lya oh khe, a Ccapaw chinaw liate Pachia te ah ccawkuthui vae oh, tuhte ccawkuthuinaw ah mue vae oh paw aening tuh a hiinnaw liate khum ah thua vae cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh kyalya thua leite, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate aening tuh ccawkuthuinaw atu ah mue vae oh zah, amaw liate Pachia kya ah lungtua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Adam te Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccemacize ccungccaw lu kheit keiccuze seinaw tuh laephi kalan yn thua zah, seinaw liate chinaw tuh yn thua, tukeiccuze ccungccaw balyn tuh marya ah sei vae oh keiccuze chinaw nynh pong oun thuanua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Gen 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawbya pya athua mawze laephi kya seinaw phe a um vae; thuasalama kawbya a um maw e seinaw tuh riapya thua loh khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhzemah Adam she kyate Moses she kyacia chinaw nynh phe a uk vae; Adam nynh a raepaw seinaw te alokuh leipaw seinaw a rae hae paw kha mah chinaw nynh phe a uk hae, tuh-e Adam tuh nyalang yn thua cih paw kya-e langsahkupaw muinsan nynh athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama alakawte muepaw lasung te seinaw tuh lokuh khyh. Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit seinaw keiccuze ccungccaw patae tuh a chi hae ze, Pachia thawccinaw te ccungccaw lu kheit athuapaw Jesu Khri thawccinaw liate alakawte muepaw lasung tuh ccungccaw patae hanlan houh alehua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit seinaw liate yn thuapaw te alakawte muepaw lasung tuh lokuh khyh, pawccecize seinaw ccangkheit nulang a zuikuhpaw byapianaw nynh seibenaw kha yn thuakhae, thuasalama seinaw patae nulang a zuikuhpaw alakawte muepaw lasung tuh thyaaccounaw nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit seinaw liate, tuh-e paw keiccuze chinaw nynh a uk; thawccinaw phe beih lan a ccou hae paw te alakawte muepaw dingnaw lasung a ccou hae paw tuh lukheitpaw, Jesu Khri liate zungzae hiinnaw a hoi cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw lu kheit seinaw nynh ccungccaw balyn kha byapianaw kalan oun thuakhae hawte, ccungccaw lu kheit dingnaw nynh ccungccaw balyn kha hiinnaw te asekuhpaw thyaaccounaw kalan oun thuakhae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit nynh kawngae khyh keiccuze ccungccaw patae tuh misei lang tangsah athua hae hawte, ccungccaw lu kheit nynh kaw a ngaenaw liate ccungccaw patae tuh miding lang tangsah athua cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Seinaw lungsah khylan Kawbya tuh yn thua; thuasalama seinaw alungnaw kya thawccinaw houh alunghua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh seinaw nynh chinaw kya a uk hawte, thawccinaw nynh mah ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate zungzae hiinnaw mue khylan thyaaccounaw liate a uk nawlan nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu ryte Chikheih Thookheih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhteze pawcihte ah ho cih oh? Thawccinaw houh alung ccaw cite seinaw tou palei ah rae cih oh? <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuhte thua khyh! Seinaw kya ah chih vae oh paw aening tuh pawtemou seinaw lungkhu ah hiin ung cih oh? <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu Khri kya baptisma ah in vae oh paw aening balyn tuh a chinaw kya baptisma phe ah in vae oh cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a chinaw kya baptisma ah in oh liate aening tuh amaw ryte uukheih ah thuabua vae oh. Tuhcite Khri tuh Paaw phu-enaw liate chinaw kyate thoosahthui athua hawte, aening mah hiinnaw thawpaw kya ah hiin cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh a chinaw kyakhe amaw ryte ah chikheih oh athua ze, a thoothuinaw kya mah amaw ryte ah thookheih cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aening ah ccungccaw rynpaw kha Khri ryte vaelantung kya khiade athua vae cipaw ah ny oh. Tuh-e tuh seinaw te asekuhpaw pyn hynh ro khylan te seinaw rya ah law vae khyh nawlan oh nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize a chih vae paw ccungccaw tuh seinaw kyate phe a lue vae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aening tuh Khri ryte ah chikheih vae oh athua ze, amaw ryte ah hiinkheih vae cih oh cite mah ah zyn oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri tuh a chih hae paw kyate thoosah thua vae zah, bua chih vae lan khyh; chinaw nynh amaw kha uk vae khyh cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri nynh a chipaw tuh seinaw hanlan chih zah zungzae hanlan vaekheit rou nynh a chi, thuasalama a hiinpaw tuh Pachia hanlan nynh a hiin. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning mah seinaw kya phe kae chih vae cite tuakuh oh lah, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate Pachia kya kae hiin cite tuakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae pynsaw rynaw kha zui khylan seinaw nynh a chihthyapaw nae pyn kha uk nan vae sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae pyn kya-e hae mah seinaw rae nawlan hoyleinaw zunghe lante la pyakuh nan oh; thuasalama chinaw kyate thoothui zah a hiin hae paw hawte Pachia kalan pyakuh oh lah, nae pyn kya-e hae kha mah dingnaw zunghe lante Pachia kalan pyakuh oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh Kawbya zakaw um vae leite, thawccinaw zakaw kya na um vae oh keiccuze seinaw nynh ae uk vae lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Dingnaw See hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhteze pawtemou? Aening tuh Kawbya zakaw um leite thawccinaw zakaw kya ah um vae oh keiccuze seinaw ah rae cih oh tou? Tuhte thua khyh! <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanning nynh naemaw te naemaw kha lukhakheit kalan khe kaw a ngaepaw see lang na pyaku oh lan athua ze, nanning tuh a kaw na ngae oh paw tuh-e paw see nynh kae thua cipaw na nyhkuh khyh oh tou? Chinaw kalan a thuakhaepaw seinaw kalan na pyaku oh ze thuasah, dingnaw kalan a thuakhaepaw kawngaenaw kalan na pyaku oh ze thuasah, nanning tuh tuh-e hae see nynh na thua oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh vaekheit lyaze seinaw see hae na la thua oh zemah, atu tuh na mue oh paw ccangpyanaw kha nae thinlung te phe na lawku vae oh keiccuze Pachia kya thehoynaw um sah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Seinaw kyate luesah na thua vae oh zah, dingnaw see lang nynh na tang vae oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae pynsaw lante na ccing khyh oh keiccuze ccungccaw bya huataw te kae hopya oh; pawccecize langmawlya tuh nae pyn kya-e hae kha ahoy leipaw rae nawlan anungsikuhpaw te ahoy leipaw see lang na la pyaku oh hawte, atu mah nae pyn kya-e hae kha athyaapaw rae nawlan dingnaw see lang pyakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh seinaw see hae na la thua lya oh kha dingnaw kyate na la lue oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Atu nae maethyakhaekupaw tuh-e uccaw hae kyate thanenaw pawmou na mue oh? Tuh-e uccaw hae athangnaw tuh chinaw nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh seinaw kyate luesah na thua vae oh zah, Pachia see lang na tang vae oh keiccuze thyaanaw hanlan thanenaw kha na mue oh, te athangnaw lan zungzae hiinnaw kha na mue cih oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize seinaw mee tuh chinaw nynh thua; thuasalama Pachia kya-e lasung tuh ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate zungzae hiinnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Zudykunaw kyate Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawbya a nyh hae paw uno hae, nae kalan kae hopya oh. Kawbya nynh ccungccaw lu kheit kha a hiin lungkhu kyalya nynh a uk cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize tungtuh vae paw nopinung tuh a vawpaw a hiin lungkhu balyn kawbya liate a vawpaw kya heede athua; thuasalama a vawpaw tuh a chi lanze a vawpaw te asekuhpaw kawbya kyate aning tuh a lue. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a vawpaw phang a hiin lyakhe ccangpaw pise te a umkheih hae ze, aning tuh vawpaw tungvaw a ohhuakuhnung cite ko athua cih; thuasalama a vawpaw tuh a chi ze, aning tuh tuh-e kawbya kyate a lue, tukeiccuze pise ccangpaw te a umkheih hae zemah vawpaw tungvaw ohhuakuhnung thua vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhawte ka uno hae, nanning mah Khri pyn liate Kawbya kya na chih vae oh; tuh-e tuh chinaw kyate a thoothuipaw, mingccangpaw Khri te a sekuh hae paw na thua oh zah Pachia hanlan athae ah thae nawlan oh nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw kya ah hiin lya oh tuh, Kawbya keiccu yn langkuhpaw sei rynaw thinlung nynh chinaw hanlan athae poukhae khylan aening ah pyn kya-e hae kyakhe rya a law. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh aening oun khiipaw Kawbya kya ah chih vae oh zah tuh-e Kawbya kyate ah lue vae oh; tukeiccuze azeikuhpaw Kawbya rynpaw kya thua leite, Muisaw kya-e hiinnaw thawpaw kya rya ah lah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawbya te Seinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhteze pawte ah ho cih oh? Kawbya tuh a sei tou? Tuhte thua khyh! Kawbya a la um khyh ze, seinaw hynh ka nyh lan khyh. Pawccecize Kawbya nynh, “Na duaa lan khyh,” cite a la ho khyh ze, kae tuh duaanaw kong hynh ka la nyh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Exo 20.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Deu 5.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama seinaw nynh kawbya liate ccyhhoy mue zah ka lungkhu kya duaanaw aphuinphuin balyn kha a poukhae; pawccecize Kawbya a um khyh ze seinaw tuh a chih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Langmawlya tuh Kawbya leite nynh ka la hiin, thuasalama kawbya he yn thua te, seinaw tuh yn hiin zah kae tuh ka chih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiinnaw pya lan bya yn kinpakuhpaw Kawbya nynh ka hanlan chinaw yn thuakhaepaw kha ka muih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize seinaw tuh Kawbya liate ccyhhoy mue zah kae kha yn ling, te tuh-e Kawbya liate kae kha yn chia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Gen 3.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Kawbya tuh athyaa, phungbya mah athyaa, ding zah ahoy.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhteze ahoypaw nynh kae kha chinaw tou yn thuakhaepya? Tuhte thua khyh! Ka kalan chinaw yn thuakhaepaw tuh seinaw thua zah, seinaw nynh seinaw athuanaw zia kha langsaku khylan ahoypaw uccaw kha a mang; tuhcite seinaw tuh Kawbya liate myaryamaw seinaw alungpaw lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thinlung kya Lungriathaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Kawbya tuh muisaw lante asekuhpaw nynh thua cipaw ah ny oh; thuasalama kae tuh pynsaw ccungccaw ka thua zah, seinaw see lang zuapaw nynh ka thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka cyipaw kha ka thaethya khyh. Ka cyi rypaw kha ka cyih khyh, ka huapaw kha nynh ka cyi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhte ka ry leipaw kha ka cyi ze, Kawbya tuh ahoy cite ka nawccawkhae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhteze atu tuh-e a cyihpaw tuh kamaw ka thua vae khyh, ka lungkhu kya umpaw seinaw nynh a cyih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize ka lungkhu, ka chiisaw kya ahoypaw kharouh um khyh cipaw ka ny; pawccecize ahmepaw cyi rynaw thinlung tuh ka lungkhu kya um salamah tuh-e tuh ka cyih kho khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize ka cyi rypaw ahoypaw kha ka cyih khyh, ka cyi ry leipaw ahoy leipaw kha nynh ka cyi. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka cyi ry leipaw kha atu ka cyi lan athua ze, tuh-e a cyihpaw tuh kamaw ka thua vae khyh, ka lungkhu umpaw seinaw nynh a cyih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhte ahoypaw ka cyi ry lyakhe ahoy leipaw tuh ka pe kya a um cite kawbya ccangkheit ka muih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kae tuh ka thinlung kya Pachia Kawbya kyakhe ka lungrythua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama ka pyn kya-e hae kya ccangpaw kawbya kha ka muih, tuh-e kawbya nynh ka thinlung kya-e kawbya kha rawse zah, ka pyn kya-e hae kya umpaw seinaw kawbya kalan khe yn kyng zah yn cciakhae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kae hynh pawcih ngaethya lan umpaw ccungccaw mou ka thua! Hynh-e chinaw pyn kyate hum nynh mou yn luesah cih? <verse number="25" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate yn luesahtupaw Pachia kya thehoynaw um sah!</para>
  <para style="p">Tukeiccuze ka thinlung tetuh Pachia Kawbya kha ka zui, thuasalama ka pynsaw lante tuh seinaw kawbya kha nynh ka zui.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Muisaw kya Hiin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu Khri Jesu kya a um hae paw tuh seibenaw um vae khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri Jesu kya umpaw hiinnaw kha yn pyatupaw Muisaw kawbya nynh seinaw kawbya kyate thuasah, chinaw kawbya kyate thuasah kae kha phe yn luesah vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw keiccuze a thawzyapaw Kawbya nynh a cyi kho leipaw kha Pachia nynh a cyi. A seipaw pynsaw muinsan lante seinaw hanlan a Ccapaw kha yn saw zah, pynsaw kya umpaw seinaw kha sei a be. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhte pynsaw rynaw thyhte hiin vae leite Muisaw rynaw thyhte a hiin hae paw aening kya Kawbya kya-e bya hae tuh accing nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw rynaw thyhte a hiin hae paw nynh tuh pynsaw te asekuhpaw uccaw hae kha nynh a tua hae; thuasalama Muisaw rynaw thyhte a hiin hae paw nynh tuh Muisaw te asekuhpaw uccaw hae kha nynh a tua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pynsaw te asekuhpaw tuanaw tuh chinaw nynh thua, thuasalama Muisaw te asekuhpaw tuanaw tuh hiinnaw te daenaw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw te asekuhpaw tuanaw tuh Pachia te arawsekuh, pawccecize tuh-e tuanaw tuh Pachia Kawbya kha zui khyh, zui mah zui kho khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pynsaw rynaw kya um hae paw nynh tuh Pachia lungtung kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh pynsaw rynaw kya na um khyh oh; Pachia Muisaw tuh nae kya a um ccaccing ze, nanning tuh Muisaw kya nynh na um oh. Khri Muisaw a hoi leipaw tuh Khri te sekuh khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khri tuh nae kya a um lanze, pyn tuh seinaw keiccu chih salamah muisaw tuh dingnaw keiccu a hiin. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu kha chinaw kyate a thoosahtupaw Pachia Muisaw tuh nae kya a um lanze, Khri kha chinaw kyate a thoosahtupaw Pachia nynh nae kya a umpaw amaw Muisaw liate a chihthyapaw nae pyn kha ae hiinsah cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Ko 3.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze uteno hae, aening tuh pynsaw rynaw thyhte hiin khylan pynsaw kya laebah ah hoi vae khyh oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw rynaw thyhte na hiin oh ze na chih cih oh; thuasalama Muisaw liate pyn a cyisahnaw kha na chisah oh ze na hiin cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia Muisaw nynh a cciakhae hae paw balyn tuh Pachia ccaaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh bua a rihthyapaw see thinlung kha Pachia kyate mue leite, ccaaw thinlung kha nynh na mue oh. “Ka Paaw! Ka Paaw!” cite aening nynh ah sia vae oh ze,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Gal 4.5-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />aening tuh Pachia ccaaw hae nynh ah thua oh cipaw Muisaw amaw ccaccei nynh aening muisaw ryte ccaekia a khan. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccaaw hae ah thua oh ze rhoccoutu hae nynh ah thua vae oh, Pachia rho a ccoutu hae te Khri ryte rho a ccoukheih hae paw nynh ah thua oh; Khri ryte ah teingkheih oh ze, amaw ryte phu-enaw kha mah ah ccoubua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize atu lya ah teing oh paw hynh aening kya yn langkuh cih paw phu-enaw te khinkhia lanze hosyn um khyh cite ka tua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize raepaw uccaw hae nynh Pachia ccaaw hae oun langku lan hae paw kha myarya ngaehoite a ngawdae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize raepaw uccaw hae tuh accakaepaw lang rae athua hae; mimaw nynh tuhte raeku a ry hae paw thua leite, a raetupaw rynaw thyhte thua zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Gen 3.17-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />raepaw uccaw hae maw mah ronaw seetangnaw kyate a lue cih hae zah, Pachia ccaaw hae kya-e aphu-epaw luenaw kha a ccoubua cih hae cite ngaehoinaw a um keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize raepaw uccaw hae balyn tuh atu cia neitangia accihpaw hawte a hawkhaekuh hae cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Raepaw uccaw hae kyalya thua leite, Muisaw kya-e masaty athae a mue hae paw aening kha mah ccaaw thuanaw athuapaw ah pyn shawkhawnaw kha ngaehoi biate ahmaw lungkhu kya ah hawkhaekuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2Ko 5.2-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh ngaehoinaw liate khum ah thua oh; thuasalama phe muih vae paw ngaehoinaw tuh ngaehoinaw thua vae khyh; pawccecize lukhakheit nynh phe a muih vae paw uccaw kha pawccemou a ngaehoi ung cih? <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama aening nynh ah muih lei oh paw kha ah ngaehoi oh ze, tuh-e tuh lungsaete ah ngaw oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhawte aening ah thawzyanaw kya Muisaw nynh oun bawm; pawccecize aening nynh pawtemou sawsang lan accan cipaw kha ah nyh khyh oh; thuasalama bya te ho kho leipaw hawkhaekunaw khate Muisaw amaw ccaccei nynh aening hanlan oun ngiapya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thinlung a ccungtupaw Pachia nynh tuh Muisaw tuanaw kha a ny; pawccecize Muisaw nynh mithyaa hae hanlan Pachia rynaw thyhte a ngiapya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pachia kha sungsah hae zah amaw a eenaw thyhte ko athua hae paw hanlan tuh Pachia nynh pawpaw balyn kha ahoy lante cci nynh pynkheihlan rya a law cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a Ccapaw kha uno hae patae laku kya ccatawccaw lang a tang ccaw cite Pachia nynh a ny typaw ccungccaw hae kha a Ccapaw muinsan te losaku khylan ccangte a nung hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhte ccangte a nung hae paw kha ko mah a ko hae; te a ko hae paw kha thyaa a ccousah hae; thyaa a ccousah hae paw kha phu-enaw a ccousah bua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu Khri kya Pachia Sungsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhteze hynh-e uccaw hae kong hynh pawtemou ah ho cih oh? Pachia tuh aening kalan a pan ze, hum nynh mou oun rawse kho cih? <verse number="32" style="v" />A Ccapaw heize haang leite aening balyn hanlan oun pyatupaw Pachia nynh Ccapaw ryte pawpaw balyn kha alakawte oun pya lan khyh tou? <verse number="33" style="v" />Pachia nynh a po hae paw kha hum nynh mou sei a be cih hae? Thyaaccousahtupaw tuh Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Seibetupaw tuh hummou? Chih zah a chi kyalya thua leite thoothui zah Pachia ranglang a umpaw, aening hanlan oun ngiapahtupaw tuh Jesu Khri nynh thua. <verse number="35" style="v" />Khri sungsahnaw kyate hum nynh mou oun phia kho cih? Vawsawnaw nynh tou? Riathaenaw nynh tou? Tuaasahkunaw nynh tou? Ccakannaw nynh tou? Ccakaete umnaw nynh tou? Rinaw nynh tou? Zunghe nynh tou oun phia kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nang keiccuze kaening tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anin ninlang oun chia hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">chia lanpaw tuu lang nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun ria hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite Ccathyaa kya azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Sam 44.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Oun phia kho lanpaw um khyh. Aening oun sungsahtupaw amaw liate, aening tuh hynh-e uccaw hae balyn kya taetu hae pasing nynh ah thua oh. <verse number="38" style="v" />Pawccecize chinaw thuasah, hiinnaw thuasah, vaaw hae thuasah, uktu hae thuasah, atu a umpaw uccaw hae thuasah, oun um cih paw uccaw hae thuasah, thungnaw huhan thuasah, <verse number="39" style="v" />ahangnaw thuasah, akhunaw thuasah, raepaw uccaw hae balyn kya-e pawpaw uccaw nynh mah thuasah, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya umpaw Pachia sungsakunaw kyate aening kha oun phia kho lan khyh cipaw ccaerarih lan ka ny.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia te Israel hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khri kya byaccing nynh ka ho, ka hyn khyh. Kamaw nykunawpaw thinlung nynh Thyaa Muisaw liate kamaw kalan te ccaekia a khanpaw tuh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae tuh myarya ka ngaethah zah ka thinlung kya lungriathaenaw thang boi khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw lante ka minphuin hae athua hae paw ka vaeccaw hae hanlan kamaw te kamaw hynh Khri te thoh phiaku lan zah thyalawnaw ccou lan cia heize ka ry. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh Israel hae thua hae zah, ccaaw thuanaw, phu-enaw, byakinnaw hae, kawbya pyanaw, Pachia beiknaw, byakinpyakupaw hae te a sekuh hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Exo 4.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin tuh minpaaw hae te mah sekuh hae zah, pynsaw lante Messiah tuh minmin kyate nynh yn thua. Aning tuh tynre balyn kya kawhoitu thua zah zungzae hythuapyatu Pachia nynh thua. Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia bya tuh tyn khyh cite ka ho rypaw thua khyh. Pawccecize Israel hae balyn hynh Israel ccaccing marya thua khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham ciihan balyn mah Abraham ccaaw hae ccaccing marya thua khyh hae; pawccecize, “Isak kya rou nynh na ciihan atyn cih,” acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Gen 21.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e asuilan tuh pynsaw ccaaw hae tuh Pachia ccaaw hae thua khyh hae; byakinpyakupaw kya-e ccaaw hae kha nynh ciihan lang ria athua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Byakinpyakupaw kya-e bya tuh hynhte acikuh: “Atu ccyh yn thua te, bua kae thua cih zah Sarah nynh ccapaw lu kheit a saah cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Gen 18.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e kyalya thua khyh, Rebeka nynh ah minpaaw Isak lu kheit liate ccaaw lu ning a poi lya mah tuh-e hawte acyihkuh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e ccaaw hae a pui maw hae, ahoypaw te athahpaw mah a rae maw hae khe, ponaw te asekuhpaw Pachia paccynnaw tuh ryalawnaw liate thua leite, amaw nynh a konaw thyhte athua nawlan, <verse number="12" style="v" />Rebeka kyakhe, “Atawccapaw nynh asoipaw kha rya a lawpah cih,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Gen 25.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Jakob tuh ka sungsah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Esau tuh ka hua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku thyhte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal 1.2-3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhteze pawcihte ah ho cih oh? Pachia tuh ding khyh tou? Tuhte thua khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh Moses kyakhe, “Ngaethya ka umsah rypaw kha ngaethya ka umsah cih zah thaw ka cci rypaw kha thaw ka ccih cih,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Exo 33.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia ponaw tuh ccungccaw rynaw liate thuasah, ryalawnaw liate thuasah thua leite, ngaethyaumsahnaw a langsakuhpaw Pachia liate nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze Faro kalan a hopaw tuh: “Nang kae hangthungnawpaw hynh nang na kya ka thungnaw langsaku khylan te ka min hynh laephi vaw balyn po thaansah khylan nynh thua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Exo 9.16</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh ngaethyaumsah rypaw kha ngaethyaumsah zah lungkhungsah rypaw kha a lungkhungsah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhteze, “Pawccemou Pachia nynh ccungccaw hynh sei oun be? Hum nynh mou a rynaw kha a khee kho cih?” cite kae hynh nae khia cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou ccungccapaw, Pachia kha rawsete byakhung lan ciate nang tuh hummou na thua? Raepaw uccaw nynh a raetupaw kha, “Pawccemou hynhcite nae rae?” cite a hopah cih tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa 29.16</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Ang raetupaw nynh anglae pum kheit mawkhate ang hoypaw lang te ang hoyleipaw lang raenaw kaw hoi khyh tou? <verse number="22" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw thinrianaw kha langsaku lan te a thungnaw kha nysah lan hae mang a ry pite, ro lan a paccyn vae paw a thinrianuapaw ang hae kya lungsaenaw pipi te phang a ngaesang lanze pawmou ho lan ung? <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia nynh phu-enaw hanlan a paccyn ty vae paw, ngaethyaumsahnaw a ccou hae paw ang hae tungvaw kya a phu-enaw kya-e hoirumnaw kha langsaku khylan phe a cyi vae zeso pawmou ho lan ung? <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh-e ang hae kyatuin Pachia nynh oun kopaw aening mah ah umbua oh; Pachia nynh Judah hae kyate kyalya ko leite Zenta hae kyate mah oun ko. <verse number="25" style="v" />Hosea kya mah Pachia nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka ccungccaw athua</para>
  <para style="q2">lei hae paw kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘ka ccungccaw hae’ cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ko cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sungsah athua leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">‘ka sungsah’ cite ka ko cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Nanning tuh ka ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua khyh oh,’ cite hopya</para>
  <para style="q1">athuanaw hae hmin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ahiinpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ccaaw hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">hopya athua cih hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel hae te asekuh lante Isaiah nynh, “Israel hae milu tuh rili kya-e laesia zeih cih hae salamah a laehy hae paw rou nynh khum athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.27-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Isa 10.22-23</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw nynh laephi vawlan hin arangte bya a pia cih,” cite a sia. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukoute Isaiah nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Vaaw Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening elang ciihan abang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">oun la haangpya khyh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">aening tuh Sodom khua hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ah thua cih oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Gomorrah khua te</para>
  <para style="q1">ah lokuh vae cih oh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1.9</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhteze pawcihte ah ho cih oh? Dingnaw mue lan a zuakuh lei hae paw Zenta hae nynh dingnaw kha a mue vae hae, tuh-e tuh zynnaw liate muepaw dingnaw nynh thua. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama kawbya te asekuhpaw dingnaw kha mue lan a zuakuh hae paw Israel hae tuh tuh-e dingnaw kha mue khyh hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccemou a mue khyh hae? Pawccecize dingnaw kha zynnaw liate thua leite, cyisahnaw liate mue khopaw hawte a zuaku hae keiccu nynh thua. Minmin tuh tuh-e thykunawpaw lung kya phe a thykuh hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dotua oh! Ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyku nawlan hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">lung te a khuliaku nawlan hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">lung kha Zion mua kya ka nung;</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a zynpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maethyanaw ccou vae lan khyh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuh hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28.16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, Israel hae hanlan ka thinlung kya ka rynaw te Pachia kalan ka sawsangnaw tuh minmin nynh khumnaw a ccou nawlan hae nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin tuh Pachia hanlan lungthawsaenaw a hoi hae cite ccaekia ka khan kho; thuasalama tuh-e lungthawsaenaw tuh ahmepaw nythyanaw thyhte thua khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh Pachia kyate yn thuapaw dingnaw kha ny leite, mimaw dingnaw kha tynsah khylan a zuaku hae keiccuze Pachia dingnaw kalan mimaw te mimaw kha pyakuh vae khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize a zynpaw ccungccaw miakaw hanlan Khri tuh dingnaw mue nawlan kawbya accingnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s">Ccungccaw balyn elang Khumnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses nynh Kawbya te asekuhpaw dingnaw kong kha zei zah, “Hynh-e hae a zuipaw ccungccaw tuh hynh-e hae liate a hiin cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama zynnaw te asekuhpaw dingnaw kong tuh hynhte nynh a ho: “ ‘Hummou vaawlang a kae cih?’ cite na thinlung kya ho nan,” (tuh-e tuh Khri kha vaawlang te sawbung lan, cinawpaw nynh thua)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Deu 30.12-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />“tuhkhyhze, ‘Hummou akhunaw lang a rungbung cih?’ cite mah na thinlung kya ho nan,” (tuh-e tuh Khri kha chinaw kyate thoosah lan, cinawpaw nynh thua) a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama pawmou bua a ho?</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bya tuh nanning te anaekuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae mung kya te</para>
  <para style="q1">nae thinlung kya nynh a um,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci. Tuh-e tuh kaening nynh kae hopaw zynnaw bya hynh nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu tuh Bawipaw nynh thua cite na mung te ccaekia na khan zah Pachia nynh amaw kha chinaw kyate a thoosah cite na thinlung kya na zyn ze, khum na thua cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw nynh a thinlung te a zyn liate thyaaccousah thua zah, a mung te ccaekia a khan liate khum athua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccathyaa nynh, “Amaw a zynpaw tuh maethyanaw ccou lan khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28.16</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize Judah minphuin te Grik minphuin laku laesahnaw um vae khyh, Bawipaw tuh ccungccaw balyn Bawipaw thua zah, amaw a kopaw balyn kha hythuanaw patae a pya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa nynh, “Bawipaw min a kopaw miakaw tuh khum athua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Joe 2.32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh a zyn khyh hae ze pawtemou a ko kho cih hae? A thae khyh hae ze pawtemou a zyn kho cih hae? Phunghotu a um khyh ze pawtemou a thae kho cih hae? <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin kha a saw khyh hae ze pawtemou phung a ho cih hae? Ccathyaa kyaze, “Thehoypaw a hotu hae ccu tuh pawcih baban apuithya!” cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hae balyn nynh thehoypaw kha zui khyh hae; pawccecize Isaiah nynh, “Bawipaw, kae hopaw bya kha hum nynh mou a zyn?” cite a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53.1</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zynnaw tuh thaenaw kyate nynh yn thua, thaenaw tuh Khri kong honaw kyate nynh yn thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama bya ka khia rypaw tuh, minmin nynh la thae loh khyh hae tou? Phe a thae ccaccing vae hae; pawccecize,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Mih roi tuh laephi pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">po zeihkuh vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih bya tuh laephi athangnaw cia</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Sam 19.4</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama bua ka khia rypaw tuh, Israel hae nynh nyh khyh hae tou? Masaty lan Moses nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Minphuin athua lei hae paw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">eiungnaw kae hoisah cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">angaeepaw minphuin khate</para>
  <para style="q1">nae thin kae riasah cih oh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a la ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Deu 32.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaiah nynh myarya rawhoyte ho zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae yn ccung lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe yn muih vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka konglang yn khia lei hae paw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka langpakuh vae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa 65.1</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae konglang Isaiah nynh ho zah, “Kawngae leipaw te eitalaepaw minphuin kalan khe anin ninlang ka kuih ka dyngpya,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa 65.2</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel tungvaw Ngaethyaumsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhteze bya ka khia rypaw tuh, Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kha a vua vae hae tou? Vua khyh hae! Pawccecize kae mah Israel ccungccaw, Abraham ciihan, Benjamin phin nynh ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia nynh a nyty vae paw a ccungccaw hae kha ccaring vua khyh hae. Elijah konglang Ccathyaa nynh a hopaw kha na nyh khyh oh tou? Aning nynh Israel hae te arawsekuh lante Pachia kalan ngia zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Bawipaw, minmin nynh na profeh hae kha theih hae zah na silawhang hae kha a ro vae hae, ka makhae nynh ka laehy vae, ka hiinnaw kha yn ccung hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Si 19.10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh bya a khungpaw tuh: “Baal pachia malang ccukharutung lei hae paw ccungccaw thong sari kha kamaw hanlan phang ka haangkuh ung hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Si 19.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhawte atu ccyh lya mah thawccinaw liate po athua hae paw a laehy ung hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawccinaw liate athua ze, cyisahnaw liate kharouh thua vae khyh; tuhkhyhze tuh thawccinaw tuh thawccinaw thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ccathyaa abang kya, ‘Cyisahnaw liate athua lanze thawccinaw liate thua vae khyh; athua lanze cyisahnaw tuh cyisahnaw thua vae khyh,’ cite a umbia.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhteze pawtemou? Israel hae nynh a ccung hae paw kha mue khyh hae. Po hae paw nynh tuh-e tuh a mue hae; tuhlaepaw hae tuh mih lungkhung. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rutatupaw thinlung,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngawmuih kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">mit te nawthae kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nakaring kha atunin cia</para>
  <para style="q2">a pya hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Deu 29.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa 29.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />David nynh, “Mih ccaboi tuh mih hanlan kaang lang te taphung lang tang sah, thykupawkunaw lang te liarunaw lang tang sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Sam 69.22-23</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mih mit tuh ngawmuih</para>
  <para style="q2">kho lei lan moh sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ke tuh zungzae ky sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zenta hae Khumnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhteze Israel hae tuh phe khuliaku lan ciate a thy a pawkuh hae tou? cite ka khia. Khuliakuh khyh hae! Thuasalama Israel hae kha eiungnaw hoisah khylan mih cyiseinaw keiccuze khumnaw tuh Zenta hae kalan a thua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu Israel hae cyiseinaw tuh laephi hoirumnaw lang yn tang zah mih nyaabungnaw tuh Zenta hae hoirumnaw lang a tang ze, mih balynte phe ccing lan la panbua hae sah lah, pawcihmou hoirumnaw houh alung cih!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zenta hae nanning kha atu kae hopya oh. Kae tuh Zenta hae elang locceihtu ka thua thyhawte, ka ryalaw kha ka hothung, <verse number="14" style="v" />tuh-e tuh ka minphuin hae kha eiungnaw hoisah khylan te minmin abang kha khumnaw ccousah khylan nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin kha vuanaw tuh laephi ccungccaw hae ccawkuthuinaw lang a tang ze, minmin kha lehkhannaw tuh chinaw kyate hiinthuinaw thua lan khyh tou? <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaety hawte pyapaw masaty e vaepoi alynkuhpaw kya-e beihtaraw kha athyaa ze sanlou tuh abalyn mawte athyaa cih; atharui tuh athyaa ze aran hae mah athyaa cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aran hae abang kha khya hae zah ramkaw e oliv thingku athuapaw nang kha minmin kya ae piade hae zah aran hae ryte pynkheihlan oliv thingku kya-e atharui te athotui kha na ccoubua lanze, <verse number="18" style="v" />a khya hae paw aran hae tungvaw la poonuakuh nan; na pooku ze nang nynh atharui kha na bawm khyh, atharui nynh nang kha ae bawm cipaw la ning nan. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhteze nang nynh, “Kae kha piade khylan nynh aran hae tuh khya athua hae,” na ci cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ahme. A zyn khyh hae keiccuze minmin tuh khya thua hae zah, nang tuh zynnaw liate kyalya nynh na thadyn. Lysakuh nan, rinaw palia kha hoi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a um typaw aran hae kha heize a haang khyh ze, nang mah ae haanglae lan khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia a thawccinaw te phe ccihtheihpaw a byapianaw kha tuatua; a khuliakuh hae paw tungvaw kya phe ccihtheih lang bya a pia hae, thuasalama nang tuh Pachia thawccinaw kya po na tyn ze, aning nynh thaw ae ccih cih; tuhzemah a thawccinaw kya na tyn khyh ze, nang mah thoh bae na thua cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel hae mah zyn leinaw kya po atyn khyh hae ze, piade bua athua cih hae; pawccecize Pachia tuh minmin bua piade nawlan thungnaw a hoi. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize amaw po lan popaw oliv ku kyate nang kha thoh ae bae hae zah linpaw oliv ku kyakhe accawkuh lei pite piade na thua lanze, a um typaw aran hae athuapaw minmin kha mimaw oliv ku kya piadepaw tuh myarya azoihua vae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel hae balyn Khumnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uteno hae, naemaw na thuanaw oh laeze na hawsaku khyh nawlan oh, hynh-e byakhupaw hynh nysah kae ry oh: Zenta hae nynh khumnaw kalan phe ccing lan a tee makhia hae, Israel hae abang kya lungkhungnaw a um ung cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel hae balyn tuh khum athua cih hae; Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Zion mua kyate Khumtu</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua cih zah, aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia pawlangria leinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob ciihan hae kyate a vua cih.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Isa 59.20</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mih seinaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he ka lawpah hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">hynh-e hynh minmin ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raepaw ka byakinnaw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Jer 31.33-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Thehoypaw te asekuh lante nanning keiccuze minmin tuh Pachia rhaw hae nynh thua hae; thuasalama ponaw te asekuh lante tuh minpaaw hae liate minmin tuh sungsah hae paw nynh thua hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia lasung hae te Pachia konaw tuh rulae kho leipaw nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize langmawlya nanning tuh Pachia kaw a ngae lei hae paw na la thua oh salamah atu tuh minmin nynh kaw a ngae khyh hae keiccuze ngaethyaumsahnaw kha na mue oh hawte, <verse number="31" style="v" />nanning nynh na mue oh paw ngaethyaumsahnaw liate minmin mah ngaethyaumsahnaw kha a muebua nawlan hae, minmin mah atu hynh kawngae khyh hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh ccungccaw balyn tungvaw kya ngaethyaumsahnaw kha a langsaku thya nawlan, mih balynte kawngae leinaw kya thong a saw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pachia hawnaw te nynaw tuh myarya ko zah akhu raria! A byapianaw hae tuh thaethya kho um khyh zah a laanpi hae tuh ny kho um khyh ccarei!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa 55.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw tuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a nyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhkhyhze hummou amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw a pya boi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40.13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">bua a pyaru nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lasung a pyaty boi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Job 41.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pawccecize pawpaw tynre balyn tuh amaw kyate, amaw liate, amaw hanlan nynh thua. Amaw kya phu-enaw zungzae um sah. Amen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Ko 8.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu kya Hiinnaw Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze uteno hae, Pachia kya-e ngaethyaumsahnaw liate kae ngia ry oh paw tuh, nae pyn kha athyaapaw te Pachia kalan douccahpaw ahiinpaw silawkunawpaw lante pyakuh oh; tuh-e tuh na cyi lan oh paw muisaw te asekuhpaw beiknaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning nynh hynh-e laephi muinsanke nan oh, thuasalama ahoypaw uccaw, ry lan umpaw uccaw te accingpaw uccaw cikuh hae paw—Pachia rynaw tuh pawmou athua cipaw na thaethya nawlan oh, nae thinlung kha thawsakute muinsan rulaekuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize kae yn pyapaw thawccinaw liate nanning lu kheit cci kha kae hopya oh; nanning nynh naemaw te naemaw kha tuaku lan accanpaw laeze ahang lante la tuakuh nan oh, thuasalama Pachia nynh milu raveih oun pyapaw zynnaw tounawpaw thyhte angaekuh lante tuakuh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize aening nynh pyn pynkheit kya pyn kya-e hae patae ah hoi oh zah, tuh-e hae balyn tuh alokuhpaw ryalaw a hoi khyh hae hawte,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1Ko 12.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />patae ah cih oh paw aening mah Khri kya pyn pynkheit ah thua oh zah, lu raveihte pyn kya-e hae nynh ah thua oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhte aening oun pyapaw thawccinaw thyhte alokuh leipaw lasung hae kha ah mue oh zah, profehbya honaw a muepaw nynh a zynnaw zeihte profehbya ho sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1Ko 12.4-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Beiknaw rya a lahtu nynh beiknaw rya kha lah sah; a ccangpahtu nynh ccangpyanaw rya kha lah sah; <verse number="8" style="v" />A hyytupaw nynh hyynaw rya kha lah sah, a pyatupaw nynh hysahnaw te pya sah; a uktupaw nynh zuakunaw te uk sah; ngaethyaumsahnaw a langsahtupaw nynh lungpawkaleihte langsah sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaaw Hiinzia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sungsakunaw kya thyaruhnaw um nan sah. Ahoy leipaw kha hua oh lah, ahoypaw kha kyngkuh oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />u te neitaw ccaccing hawte lu kheit te lu kheit sungsakuh oh; sawtuakunaw kya lu kheit te lu kheit sawtuakuh kalang oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thawzung thuanaw kya thawnaw leite thinlung ccaccingte Bawipaw rya kha lah oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngaehoinaw kya nae lungpaw sah; vawsawnaw kya nae lungsae sah, sawsangnaw kya tyty tyn oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mithyaa hae kha mih hobounaw kya la bawmbua oh; mikhia hae kha kou hoy lan la do-oih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vawsawnaw ae pya oh paw kha hythuapya oh; minmin kha hythuapya oh lah thyalaw nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5.44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk 6.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungtua hae paw ryte lungtuabua oh lah, a rah hae paw ryte la rahbua oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Lu kheit te lu kheit lunglokute la um oh. Lysaku nan oh, a nyaa hae paw ryte vaeccawtang oh. Ka haw cite tuakuh nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Ptb 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Humhung sanmah athahpaw hanlan athahpaw te liaru nan oh, ccungccaw balyn muihnaw kya ahoypaw uccaw tuanaw hoi oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Athua kho ze, ccungccaw hae balyn ryte ccawkute la um oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sungsah hae paw, naemaw nynh kharouh liaru nan oh, Pachia thinrianaw kalan pya oh, pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze, “Liarunaw tuh kamaw kya-e nynh thua, kamaw nynh ka liaru cih, cite Bawipaw nynh a ci,” cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Deu 32.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, “Na rhawpaw kha a vuelaw ze looh la dang; a tuihaw ze nia lanpaw kha la pya; pawccecize tuhte na cyinaw liate nang nynh tuh-e paw lu vawlan maee-e hae kha na pumpah cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Ptb 25.21-22</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Athahpaw kha la taesakuh nan oh, athahpaw kha ahoypaw te la tae oh.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawhoinaw kha Sawtua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh uktu hae kaw kha ngae hae sah; pawccecize Pachia kyate laelan kawhoinaw um khyh, atu kawhoitu hae paw hynh mah Pachia liate khangpaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze humhung zemah kawhoipaw a rawsepaw tuh Pachia nynh a khangpaw kha a rawsepaw nynh thua, tuhte a rawse hae paw tuh byapianaw a ing cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize uktu hae tuh ahoypaw ryalah hae paw nynh ri lanpaw thua khyh, thuasalama athahpaw ryalah hae paw nynh a ri lan hae paw nynh thua. Kawhoipaw kha ri leite na um ry tou? Ahoypaw rya kha lah lah, aning nynh nang kha ae thehoysah cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize aning tuh nang na hoynaw hanlan Pachia ryalahtu nynh thua. Thuasalama ahoy leipaw rya na law ze la rih, pawccecize aning tuh thaloi kha alakaw lan ccyng khyh! Aning tuh athahpaw rya a lahpaw tungvaw kya thinrianaw thuakhae zah detahtupaw Pachia ryalahtu nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia thinrianaw keiccu kyalya kawngae lanpaw thua leite, ahmaw te ahmaw nykunaw thinlung keiccu mah kawngae lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze nanning mah ngunto pya oh, pawccecize uktu hae tuh Pachia ryalahtu hae thua hae zah, tuh-e rya tuh hoyte a law hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat 22.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk 20.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw miakaw kha mue lan a ccan hae thyhte la pya oh—ngunto pya lan a ccanpaw kha ngunto pya oh; ngunto pya lan a ccanpaw kha ngunto pya oh, rawri lan a ccanpaw kha a rawrih oh; sawtua lan a ccanpaw kha sawtua oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lu Kheit te Lu Kheit Sungsakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lu kheit te lu kheit sungsaku lanpaw laelan hum kya sanmah laebah um nan oh; pawccecize mingccangpaw a sungsahpaw ccungccaw tuh kawbya kha phe a ccingsah vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize, “Milae zu kya khyhze milae vawpaw kya na sei lan khyh, ccungccaw na theih lan khyh, na ruh lan khyh, milae uccaw na duaa lan khyh,” cikuhpaw kawbya hae te ccangpaw kawbya hae tuh, “Na innpaw kha namaw na sungsaku hawte la sungsah,” cikuhpaw kawbya kyakhe marya a ccakhungkuh hae.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abang Ccathyaa kya, ‘ahme leipaw ccaekia na khan lan khyh’ cite a umbia.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Exo 20.13-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Deu 5.17-19</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Sungsakunaw nynh tuh a innpaw kya ahoy leipaw rae boi khyh. Tukeiccuze sungsakunaw tuh kawbya ccingnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhpiaze atu ccyh hynh paw ccyh mou athua cipaw na ny oh, nanning hanlan inaw kyate thaeku ccyh athua vae; pawccecize aening ah zyn takaw lya oh laeze atu lya hynh khumnaw tuh aening te anaekuh hua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuazi tuh vyavya thang zah khuadae thua lan cih vae, tukeiccuze aening nynh mohnaw ryalaw hae kha vua ccavae oh sih lah, awnaw rhaw uccaw kha lawkuh ccavae oh sih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Poituakunaw te zu-aenaw, ruinaw, ccouseikunaw, ohhuaku rynaw, ziaku buakunaw te eiungkunaw kyakhe um leite, ninthu ccyh kya um hae paw hawte kou ngaekuh lante hiin oh sih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu Khri kha boeining hawte lawkuh oh lah, pynsaw rynaw kha ccingsah lan paccynkuh nan oh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Milae kha Byapia Nan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zynnaw kya a thawzyapaw kha lehkhan oh, thuasalama zynsei lan umpaw eikunaw kha raekhae nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.1-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw abang nynh aepaw miakaw tuh ae lan accan cite a zyn hae, thuasalama a thawzyapaw nynh tuh enaw-rohnaw rou kha nynh a ae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn a aepaw nynh a ae leipaw kha dothatheih nan sah, te a ae leipaw nynh a aepaw kha byapia nan sah, pawccecize Pachia nynh tuh-e paw tuh lehkhan vae paw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ming hae rya a lahtupaw kha bya a piapaw nang tuh hummou na thua? Aning tuh a thadyn zemah, a khuliaku zemah amaw a bawipaw te nynh aseku. Aning tuh thadynsah athua cih, pawccecize Bawipaw nynh aning kha a thadynsah kho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh nin kheit tuh ccangpaw nin laeze asunghua cite a tua, mingccangpaw nynh nin miakaw tuh phe lokuh lante a tua. Ccungccaw balyn nynh mih thinlung kya tynkaring lan zynkuh hae sah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ninsaw kha a sungpaw ccungccaw tuh Bawipaw sawtuanaw te nynh a sung, ninsaw kha a sung leipaw ccungccaw mah Bawipaw sawtuanaw te nynh a sung khyh; a aepaw ccungccaw mah Bawipaw sawtuanaw te nynh a ae, pawccecize Pachia kalan lungtuabya a ho; te a ae leipaw ccungccaw mah Bawipaw sawtuanaw te ae khyh zah Pachia kalan lungtuabya a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aening tuh hum sanmah ahmaw hanlan ah hiin khyh oh, hum sanmah ahmaw hanlan ah chih khyh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh ah hiin oh zemah Bawipaw hanlan nynh ah hiin oh; ah chi oh zemah Bawipaw hanlan nynh ah chi oh; tukeiccuze ah hiin oh zemah, ah chi oh zemah Bawipaw kya-e nynh ah thua oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri tuh a chihpaw te a hiinpaw parouh kya-e Bawipaw lang tang khylan chih zah a thoothui.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccemou nang nynh na uno kha bya na pia? Pawccemou na uno kha pawlangria leite na um? Pawccecize aening balyn tuh Pachia a byapianaw tungkhung malang khe ah thadyn cih oh paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Ko 5.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bawipaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Kae tuh ka hiin thyhawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang ccukharu a tung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih munglae raveihte</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kha the a hoysah cih hae,’</para>
  <para style="q1">a ci,” cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45.23</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening lu raveih nynh ahmaw konglang ccazing kha Pachia kalan ah pya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Milae kha Khuliasakuh Nan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aening lu kheit te lu kheit byapiakuh nan vae oh sih; uno lu kheit nynh a ccianaw kya thykunawpaw tuhkhyhze khuliakunawpaw kha papin nungkhaw lei lante byapae ccavae oh sih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawpaw looh sanmah amaw thu lang thu khyh cipaw Bawipaw Jesu liate ccaerarih lan ka ny; thuasalama hankhakheit kha thyaa khyh cite a tuapaw ccungccaw elang tuh tuh-e tuh a hanlan thyaa khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Na aepaw keiccuze na uno tuh a thinlungcci lanze nang tuh sungsakunaw kya na hiin khyh. Khri nynh a hanlan a chipyapaw ccungccaw kha na aepaw te la roh nan. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nae kya-e ahoypaw kha athahpaw hawte thethya la hosah nan oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia peenaw tuh aepaw te niapaw hynh thua leite, Thyaa Muisaw kya dingnaw, daenaw te lungpawnaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize hynhcite Khri rya a lahpaw tuh Pachia malang nawccaw lan umpaw thua zah ccungccaw hae nynh mah the a hoysah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze daenaw a thuakhaepaw uccaw hae te lu kheit te lu kheit laku thawzung lang a tangsahpaw uccaw hae kha deehui oh sih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia ryalaw kha looh keiccuze roh nan. Looh miakaw tuh athyaa ccaccing; thuasalama nang nynh na aepaw keiccuze ming hae khuliasaku nawlan a tang lanze nang tuh na sei vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Na uno a khuliasakuhpaw saw aepaw te misutui niapaw kha ae lei, nia leite, pawpaw san cyi leipaw tuh ahmepaw nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Na hoipaw zynnaw tuh Pachia malang namaw hanlan hoi; amaw nynh a nawccawpaw hanlan amaw te amaw seibekuh leipaw ccungccaw tuh lungtuapaw nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama lunghiinnaw a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh a ae ze, zynnaw leite a ae keiccu seibe athua; pawccecize zynnaw leite cyipaw miakaw tuh seinaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ming hae kha Lungtuasah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thawsae hae paw aening nynh thawzya hae paw kya-e thawzyanaw kha ngaesang aho; ahmaw rynaw kha ccungku lanpaw thua khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aening lu raveih nynh ah innpaw paw elang hoynaw kha tuate zynnaw kya a lethung nawlan a rynaw kha ccungpah oh sih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri nynh heize amaw a rynaw kha ccungkuh khyh. Ccathyaa kyaze, “Nang ae saryatu hae nynh ae saryanaw hae paw bya tuh ka tungvaw accah vae,” cite azeiku hawte nynh athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sam 69.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kya a umpaw ngaesangnaw te thawpyanaw liate aening nynh ngaehoinaw ah hoi nawlan oh, Ccathyaa kya langmawlya e azeikuhpaw miakaw tuh aening thuiheinaw elang nynh zei athua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngaesangnaw te thawpyanaw Pachia nynh Khri Jesu rynaw thyhte lu kheit te lu kheit lunglokute na um nawlan oh ae bawm vae oh sah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a Paaw athuapaw Pachia kha nanning nynh lunglokute pynkheihlan roisawte na thehoysah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s">Judah hae te Zenta hae elang Thehoypaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Khri nynh nanning kha leh ae khan oh hawte nanning mah Pachia phu-enaw hanlan lu kheit te lu kheit lehkhankuh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize kae hopya ry oh paw tuh: Jesu Khri tuh minpaaw hae kalan pya athuapaw byakinpyakupaw hae kha ccingsah khylan Pachia byaccing kha langsaku lan vingdungawkuh hae paw kya-e ryalahtu lang a tang vae; <verse number="9" style="v" />tuhpiaze Zenta hae nynh Pachia kha a ngaethyaumsahnaw hanlan phu-enaw a pya nawlan hae nynh thua. Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Tukeiccuze Zenta hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thehoysah cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na min thehoysahnaw hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sah cih,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Sa 22.50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Sam 18.49</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pou Zenta hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuakheih oh,” cite bua a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Deu 32.43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Zenta hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw kha thehoysah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha thehoysah oh,” bua a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sam 117.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isaiah nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Jessi tharui tuh yn pou cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh Zenta hae uk khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh cih paw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Zenta hae nynh amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaehoikuh cih hae,” bua a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11.10</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning tuh Thyaa Muisaw thungnaw liate ngaehoinaw te phe na bia nawlan oh, ngaehoinaw Pachia nynh zynnaw kyate yn thuapaw lungtuanaw te daenaw phuinccing khate ae la biasah vae oh sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Paul nynh Rawhoyte Ccaw Kynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka uno hae, nanning tuh hoynaw te nynaw balyn khate phe na beih oh zah, lu kheit te lu kheit na thuiheikuh kho oh cipaw nanning konglang phe ka ny. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning nynh bua na tuathui ccaw oh cite Pachia nynh yn pyapaw thawccinaw liate abang akonglang kyakhe rawhoyte nae kalan ccaw kae zei; <verse number="16" style="v" />tuh-e a thawccinaw tuh kae hynh Pachia thehoypaw a hopaw ranpibawi ryalaw kya Zenta hae hanlan Jesu Khri a ryalahtu ka thuapaw hynh nynh thua; tuhteze nynh Zenta hae kya-e silawkunaw tuh Thyaa Muisaw liate athyaa cih zah douccahpaw athua cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia hanlan rya ka lawnaw kya Jesu Khri liate ka pookunaw lanpaw a um. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Zenta hae nynh kaw a ngae nawlan hae, bya te cyisahnaw liate thuasah, <verse number="19" style="v" />muihsahnaw hae te ngaeangnaw hae kya-e thungnaw liate thuasah, Pachia Muisaw thungnaw liate thuasah Khri nynh kae kha yn mang zah a cyipaw laelan, pawsang mah ka ho ngan khyh; tuhcite kae nynh Jerusalem kyate tho zah Ilyrikam ram pepan kyacia Khri thehoypaw kha phe ccing lan ka ho. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccangpaw ccungccaw nynh a bingpaw aleihpaw vawlan khe kae nynh ka sak khyh nawlan, Khri min a phy boi leinaw hae hmin kyakhe thehoypaw ho lan thawte ka zuaku. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Amaw konglang a hopya</para>
  <para style="q2">lei hae paw nynh a muih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw konglang</para>
  <para style="q2">a thae boi lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thaethya cih hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa 52.15</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Rom lang Paebua lan Paul Paccynkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze nae kalan ccia lan yn khawpaw patae a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom 1.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh hynh-e ram hae kya ryalawnaw hmin ka hoi vae khyh zah nae kalan ccia lan ka rynaw mah kum patae aro vae hawte, <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain ram lang he ka cceih te, nae kalan kae cceih cih. Pawccecize khua ka ccongnaw kya nanning ryte muihku lan zah, lungpawte sosoh ah umkheih kou oh te, nanning nynh tuh-e ram lang bua nae saw cih oh cite ka ngaehoi. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh mithyaa hae bawmnawpaw uccaw hae ryte Jerusalem lang ka la cceih ung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1Ko 16.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize Mesidonia ram e ccungccaw hae te Akhai ram e ccungccaw hae hynh Jerusalem kya um hae paw mithyaa hae laku e ryachi hae kha neethungbua hae zah mih lungrythuakhaekuh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhte a cyi hae paw kya mih lungrythua, minmin tuh Judah hae kya laebah a um ccaccing hae; pawccecize Zenta hae nynh Judah hae kya-e muisaw hythuanaw hae kha a ccoubua hae ze, pynsaw hythuanaw hae kya mah minmin nynh Judah hae kha a neethungbua hae aho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Ko 9.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynh-e rya hynh ka thangsah zah, a hlu hae paw hynh mih kalan ka ap kou hae te, Spain ram lang ka cceih cih zah nae kya kae teepaw cih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Nae kya he kae thua te, Khri hythuanaw phe ccingpaw te kae thua cih cipaw ka ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uteno hae, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri te Thyaa Muisaw sungsahnaw liate nanning nynh kamaw ryte sawsangnaw kya na zuakuh oh zah, Pachia kalan ka hanlan saw nae sangpya nawlan oh kae ngia oh; <verse number="31" style="v" />Judea ram kya-e zynleitu hae kuih kyate ka lue nawlan te Jerusalem khua hanlan rya ka lawpaw hynh mithyaa hae nynh yn lawpyaku nawlan hae saw yn la sangpah oh; <verse number="32" style="v" />tuhteze nynh Pachia rynaw thyhte nae kalan lungpawte kae thua cih zah nanning liate thawzung thawpaw ka mue cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Daenaw Pachia tuh nanning balyn ryte la um sah. Amen.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lu Raveih Beihlangkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kenkhrea khua kya a umpaw khriccaawbuu kya ryalahtu athuapaw ah ccianung Fibi hynh nae kya nysah kae ry oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mithyaa hae nynh cyi lan accan thyhte nanning nynh amaw kha Bawipaw min te leh la khan oh lah, bawm ahonaw miakaw kya la bawmbua oh; pawccecize aning tuh ccungccaw patae a bawmtu te kamaw mah yn bawmtu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya kae te rya kae lahkheih hae paw Prisilla te Akuila kha la beih oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Loc 18.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />minmin tuh ka hiinnaw hanlan a chih ngan hae paw nynh thua; kae kyalya nynh thua leite Zenta khriccaawbuu hae balyn nynh mah minmin tungvaw kya mih lungtua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih inn kya a pumkuh hae paw khriccaawbuu kha mah la beih oh. Asia ram kyaze Khri hanlan masaty zyntu athuapaw, ka sungsahpaw Epainetan kha la beih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning elang ryalaw myarya a zuakuhpaw Mary kha la beih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kae te thong kae ccahkheih hae paw, ka vaeccaw hae Andronikan te Junia kha la beih oh; minmin tuh locceihtu hae kyaze minthaan hae paw thua hae zah, kamaw laeze Khri kya a umty hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipaw kya ka sungsahpaw Ampliatas kha la beih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Khri kya rya kae lahkheihtu Urbanas te ka sungsahpaw Stakhus kha la beih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khri kya a lungzipaw Apelen kha la beihlang oh. Aristobulas innbyn hae kha la beih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka vaeccaw athuapaw Herodion kha la beih oh. Bawipaw kya um hae paw Narkissu innbyn hae kha la beih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipaw kya ryalahtu athua hae paw Trifana te Trifosa kha la beih oh. Bawipaw kya thawte ryalahpaw, sungsahpaw Persis kha la beih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipaw kya popaw Rufas te ka nung hawte athuapaw a nung kha la beih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar 15.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinkritas, Flegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas te minmin ryte a umkheih hae paw uteno hae kha la beih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Filologas te Julia, Nereas te a ccianung, te Olimpas te minmin ryte a umkheih hae paw mithyaa hae balyn kha la beih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Athyaapaw myngkunaw te lu kheit te lu kheit la beihkuh oh. Khri kya-e khriccaawbuu hae balyn nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh.</para>
  <para style="s">Nyathya Byatawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uteno hae, na ccangku vae oh paw ccangpyakunaw te arawsekuhpaw buu phianaw te cyiseinaw a pousahtu hae kha na raeringku nawlan oh kae ngia oh; minmin kha la sibia oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae tuh ah Bawipaw Khri rya kha law leite mimaw vue hanlan nynh rya a lawku hae; ahoypaw bya te nawpalaepaw bya hae khate ccungccaw hoy hae paw thinlung kha leih a ling hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw balyn nynh kaw na ngaenaw oh kha a ny vae hae keiccuze nae tungvaw ka lungtua; ahoypaw kya hawnaw na hoi nawlan oh te ahoy leipaw kya seinaw na hoi khyh nawlan oh ka ry. <verse number="20" style="v" />Daenaw Pachia nynh aro mawze Satan kha nae ccu kaw kya yn miade cih. Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri thawccinaw tuh nae kya la um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kae te rya kae lahkheihpaw Timote te ka vaeccaw hae Lusias, Jason te Sosipater nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Loc 16.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />E ccaky a zeitupaw kae, Terti nynh Bawipaw kya nanning kha kae beihlang oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kae te khriccaawbuu balyn kha innccong oun ua zah oun do-oihtu Kaias nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. Khuapi suaccytu Erastas te nae uno Kuartas nynh ae beihlang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Loc 19.29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Ko 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2Ti 4.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri thawccinaw tuh nae balyn kya la um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athangnaw Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hopaw thehoypaw te Jesu Khri kong phunghonaw thyhte thuasah, langmaw she lungkhu balyn thuruh thua salamah atu lya phy athua vae paw, byakhupaw kya-e byaphy thyhte thuasah, Pachia nynh nanning kha zynnaw kya thawzung ae tynsah kho oh, <verse number="26" style="v" />thuasalama atu tuh zynnaw te asekuhpaw kawngaenaw a um nawlan, zungzae tynpaw Pachia kya-e kawpyanaw thyhte, profeh hae nynh a zei hae paw Ccathyaa hae liate, tuh-e byakhupaw tuh Zenta hae balyn kalan nysah athua vae; <verse number="27" style="v" />amaw kyalya ahawpaw Pachia tuh Jesu Khri liate zungzae a phu-e sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>